@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title UML 2.5 Component Diagram – Building block view, level 1
skinparam componentStyle uml2
left to right direction

actor "Cashier /\nManager" as user
component "Web front end\n<<SPA>>\nReact 18 · TypeScript" as web
component "API\n<<service>>\nFastAPI · Python 3.11" as api
database "PostgreSQL" as db

interface "UI\n(HTTPS)" as ui
interface "REST API\n/api/* + JWT" as rest
interface "Photos\n/media/*" as media
interface "SQL" as sql

user ..> ui
web -up- ui
web ..> rest : <<use>>
web ..> media : <<use>>
api -up- rest
api -up- media
api ..> sql : <<use>>
db -up- sql

note bottom of db
  Only the API talks to the database.
  Row locks and CHECK (stock >= 0)
  stop overselling (NFR-04).
end note

legend bottom
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | box with component icon | component (replaceable building block) |
  | ○— (lollipop) | interface provided by the component it touches |
  | - - -> <<use>> | the source requires that interface |
  | cylinder | data store |
endlegend
@enduml
